, b)` where `a ∈ l₁` and `b ∈ l₂ a`.\n```\nsigma [1, 2] (λ_, [(5 : Nat), 6]) = [(1, 5), (1, 6), (2, 5), (2, 6)]\n``` -/\nprotected def sigma {σ : α → Type _} (l₁ : List α) (l₂ : ∀ a, List (σ a)) : List (Σ a, σ a) :=\n  l₁.flatMap fun a => (l₂ a).map (Sigma.mk a)","start":519,"end":524},"axioms":[]}